      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is a case report of primary omental torsion that occurred in a 21-year-old man who presented with right lower quadrant abdominal pain. His provisional diagnosis was appendicitis. He was explored for appendicitis but the finding was twisted omentum."},
